  "visualBrief": "Individual medium-fi Sarlat exterior: irregular mapped aisles/chapels and attached south range; oblique high nave and polygonal choir; tall pointed glass, open flying buttress arches, round stair turret; Romanesque tower-porch with rectangular timber portal, blind arches, triple lights, paired louvered belfry lights, small clock and layered slate bulb roof/open lantern. Five shared texture graphs, four browser LODs. Fine sculpture and interiors simplified or excluded.",
